ndered what it\u2019s like to be an unstoppable gorilla in a showdown against a hundred humans? Welcome to your primal playground.\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Gorilla Tag\u2013Inspired Locomotion \u2013 Move like a beast using knuckle-walking and swinging physics-based traversal.\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Unleash the Jungle Fury \u2013 Grab, toss, and SMASH enemies with raw gorilla strength. \u2013 Perform brutal punches and devastating ground slams.\n\n\ud83e\ude78 Survive the Horde \u2013 Take down every enemy before your health runs out. \u2013 Master your momentum, maximize your mayhem.\n\n\u23f1\ufe0f Speed Equals Glory \u2013 The faster you eliminate the mob, the higher your score climbs.", "short_description": "Unleash your inner gorilla and battle a crowd of 100 men! Welcome to your primal playground!\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Gorilla tag\u2013Inspired Locomotion: Move like a beast using knuckle-walking and swinging physics-based traversal\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Unleash the Jungle Fury: Grab, toss, & SMASH enemies with raw gorilla strength!\n\n\ud83e\ude78 Survive the Horde: Take down every enemy before your health runs out \u2013 Master your momentum, maximize your mayhem!\n\n\u23f1\ufe0f Speed Equals Glory \u2013 The faster you eliminate the mob, the higher your score climbs!"}]}, "developer_name": " Richard - Amir - Vijay - Michael - Julian - Javed - ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/amirmohideen/GorillaVs100MenPrivacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "10XVAR", "support_website_url": "https://discord.com/invite/DT6B3whWGx", "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@10XVAR", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQ